# RiverMind card art: the corner indices, the suit pips and the court
# portraits. scripts/pixel-art/cards.js lays them out on a 33 × 45 card.
# Hand-drawn, one character per pixel; see palette.hex for the colors.

# --- Rank indices: 5 × 7, two-pixel stems so they read at a glance. "10" is
# 7 wide. Drawn in the suit's ink (@ink).

