# --- Small pips: 5 wide, for the corner index and the number cards. Spades
# and clubs take a sixth row for the stem. Upright; the lower half of a card
# uses them rotated 180°.

legend
. clear
S @suit

sprite pip-spades
..S..
.SSS.
SSSSS
SSSSS
..S..
.SSS.


sprite pip-hearts
.S.S.
SSSSS
SSSSS
.SSS.
..S..

sprite pip-diamonds
..S..
.SSS.
SSSSS
.SSS.
..S..

sprite pip-clubs
.SSS.
.SSS.
SSSSS
SSSSS
S.S.S
..S..


# --- Large pips: up to 15 × 15, for the aces. Lit from the top-left (@light) with a
